{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-16",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "AUTHOR CANDIDATE ONLY: bounded human-authorized repair of the actual old first-visual-FAIL. Context: /Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-3695/lemmadeck/.tmp/resume182-6-8a-n8-fig16-author3695-FIRST/context.json; SHA-256 d9d2b7c80aab09243bb8e0671e10ea2419b16adc185b4365e5b6c51924880ea9. Independent source inventory was sealed after one original PNG view and before the old package was read. Preserve all old geometry/assertion values, the 38 by 27 grid, finite circle/line, A(-8,6), B(6,-8), and B label offset 60. Hide the seven unprinted construction anchors using existing visible:false; O is a separate text label at the unchanged origin/label offset. Only y and y-unit receive fixed left clearance. Exact lattice/circle/extrema/terminals, semantic colors, enlarged upright equation text and A/B point emphasis are modern regularization/additions, not extra source point glyphs. No candidate image has been opened, no visual or full-task math approval is claimed, and no promotion or publishing is authorized. One new content repair; the old ordinary repair budget is 0/exhausted and is not reset.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-3695/lemmadeck/ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/8a/figures/fig-16.png",
      "sha256": "24b40725964951ef8af6597a21d32922015802b7a65ee427d5b52add78fe3ca4"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n8",
        "text": "我们用图解法解这个方程组. 为此在同一个坐标系上作出方程$x^2+y^2=100$和$x+y=-2$的图象（图16）."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n8",
        "text": "换句话说，解方程组就是要找出这个方程组中各方程的解集合的交集."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n8",
        "text": "例1 解方程组$\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=100,\\\\x+y=-2.\\end{cases}$ （1）"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n8",
        "text": "图16"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n8",
        "text": "圆周和直线相交于点$A(-8,6)$和$B(6,-8)$. 每一个交点的坐标既是方程组的第一个方程的解，又是第二个方程的解，也就是方程组的解."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n8",
        "text": "因此，方程组（1）有两个解：\n$(-8,6)$和$(6,-8)$."
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "fig-16-source-panel-lattice",
        "description": "One rectangular coordinate panel with no subpanels, data table, answer cells or row/column headers. Pixel-counted 39 vertical and 28 horizontal rulings including boundary give 38 columns and 27 rows, 1026 lattice cells. Unoccupied cells are blank. Origin O is 19 cells from either vertical boundary, 14 below the top and 13 above the bottom. Printed 1 labels identify one cell as one unit on both axes. Finite lattice bounds x=-19..19, y=-13..14, step 1, phase 0. Grid and outer frame are solid, without dashed rows, gaps or staggered offsets.",
        "objects": [
          "fig-16-grid",
          "fig-16-frame"
        ],
        "assertions": [
          "fig-16-grid-38-by-27"
        ],
        "requires": [
          "gridDimensions"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "fig-16-source-axes-labels",
        "description": "Visible ink: solid coordinate axes, positive right/up arrowheads, x, y, O text and two positive unit 1 labels. O has no source point glyph; the mapped O is text, not the hidden origin anchor. The hidden origin is an unchanged construction addition retained for circle and displacement assertions. y and y-unit text have fixed left clearance as the bounded old-FAIL repair; axis geometry, labels and units are unchanged.",
        "objects": [
          "fig-16-x-axis",
          "fig-16-y-axis",
          "fig-16-origin-text",
          "fig-16-x-label",
          "fig-16-y-label",
